581707786\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br>Zheltikov is a scientific-military base dedicated to the study of the volcano of the same name. The facility has grown like a huge and distorted creature in the surroundings of the mountain... And even inside! Different experiments related to Zheltikov\u2019s unique lava were conducted across the base, including some tests focusing on the correlation between geological phenomena and the human psyche\u2026 And then the volcano erupted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.webm?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/ca282146d77a7a57084dbed8d41db9eb.mp4?t=1581707786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/2663a8b8c926d4e54ed05d3c64a670d4.avif?t=1581707786\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><i>Featuring:</i><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>A semi open world fps adventure with quests, side quests and environmental puzzles.<br></li><li>Discover different types of ways of distorting enemies bodies: sticky lumps, heavy lumps, floating lumps and more!<br></li><li>Communicate to a wide variety of characters, examine different objects and draw your own conclusions in a dark and rich narrative world.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223140/extras/c2edc576907e0355ecc5e49f1a395321.poster.avif?t=1581707786\" widt